Working-tree edits (not in the .patch -- per HARD BUILD-
SERIALIZATION, working-tree-only):
- docs/internal/BOOT.md: new SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_PIXTONE_PROBE entry
  inserted between SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_AUDIO_TICKPUMP and
  SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_DATA_CACHE. Covers: opt-in semantics, line-
