- tests/run-gameplay-smoke.sh: BANNER_REGEX +1 entry for the
  probe boot banner; BANNER_SEVERITY +1 "optional"; BANNER_LABEL
  +1 long-form description following the 0163/0164 label pattern.
  Three array sizes stay aligned.

Single-lever-per-binary: the probe is THE operator-visible
mechanism this binary's new patch introduces. SDL-side
patches/SDL/0069 (the monotonic silent-IRQ counter export) lands
in parallel; both load into the same binary but their
killswitches are independent (SDL/0069 unconditional + always
exported; nxengine/0165 opt-in via the probe hint).

